{
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "c06-title-01",
   "scene": "c06-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter six. On a verb: the object.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-intro-01",
   "scene": "c06-intro",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Put one of the twelve pronouns on a past verb or an order verb, and it is the object.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "b:0",
    "hl:is the object"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-intro-02",
   "scene": "c06-intro",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The object is naṣb.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:The object is naṣb"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-intro-03",
   "scene": "c06-intro",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pronoun is fixed, so it is in the place of naṣb.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:in the place of naṣb"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-intro-04",
   "scene": "c06-intro",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فِي مَحَلِّ نَصْبٍ",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "ar:فِي مَحَلِّ نَصْبٍ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-01",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "He opened the door.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "b:0",
    "ex:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-02",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فَتَحَ البَابَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:فَتَحَ البَابَ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-03",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "He opened it.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-04",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فَتَحَهُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:فَتَحَهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-05",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pronoun for it takes the place of the door.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "note:0",
    "ar:ـهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-06",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "البَابَ",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "ar:البَابَ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-07",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The girl opened it.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-08",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فَتَحَتْهُ البِنْتُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:فَتَحَتْهُ البِنْتُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-09",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pronoun comes right after the verb, before the doer.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "note:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-10",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The teacher wrote it. It means the letter.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-11",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كَتَبَهَا المُدَرِّسُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كَتَبَهَا المُدَرِّسُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-12",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "In Arabic, the word for a letter you write is feminine. So we use the pronoun for she.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "note:2",
    "ar:ـهَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-13",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It is the object, in the place of naṣb.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-14",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Read the book.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-15",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اِقْرَأِ الكِتَابَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:اِقْرَأِ الكِتَابَ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-16",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Read it.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-17",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اِقْرَأْهُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:اِقْرَأْهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-18",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Before al, the order verb had a small helping kasra, only to make it easy to say. It is not jarr.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "note:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-19",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "With the pronoun, the order verb keeps its sukūn.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ar:اِقْرَأْ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-20",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اِقْرَأْ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "ar:اِقْرَأْ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-21",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Then the pronoun for it is added.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـهُ#2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-22",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Write it.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-23",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اُكْتُبْهُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:اُكْتُبْهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-ex-24",
   "scene": "c06-ex",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pronoun for it is the object, in the place of naṣb.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "note:4",
    "ar:ـهُ#3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-tips-01",
   "scene": "c06-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Tip. Past verbs also have endings for the doer.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "b:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-tips-02",
   "scene": "c06-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I,",
   "pause": 0.2,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـتُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-tips-03",
   "scene": "c06-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "you,",
   "pause": 0.2,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـتَ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-tips-04",
   "scene": "c06-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "and we.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـنَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-tips-05",
   "scene": "c06-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "They are pronouns too. We learn them in unit six.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:They are pronouns too"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-tips-06",
   "scene": "c06-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "One more tip. On a verb, the pronoun for me has an extra letter.",
   "pause": 0.2,
   "cues": [
    "b:1",
    "ar:ـنِي"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-tips-07",
   "scene": "c06-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "This one.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ن"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-tips-08",
   "scene": "c06-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "We meet it later.",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "hl:We meet it later"
   ]
  }
 ]
}